[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/953903100","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1344#issuecomment-953903100","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1344","id":953903100,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE84422f8","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-10-28T14:28:45Z","updated_at":"2021-10-28T14:28:45Z","body":"+1 to add, particularly since (as you noted) SPDX has now adopted it for the SPDX spec going forward  :)\r\n\r\nNote that the primary URL for the license is at https://github.com/CommunitySpecification/1.0/blob/master/1._Community_Specification_License-v1.md -- would suggest using this for the crossref rather than the spdx/governance URL.\r\n\r\nQuick thoughts on inclusion principles:\r\n\r\n**Definitive factors**: meets all of these. On versioning, note that in the org linked above they appear to be breaking it out into a \"1.0\" repo, so presumably new versions will be in separate repos / at separate URLs.\r\n\r\n**Other factors**:\r\n\r\n1. Yes, I'd say that the broad copyright license grant satisfies the Free Cultural Works definition.\r\n2. Yes, generally usable by anyone\r\n3. Not very widespread yet, though SPDX has adopted it, as has [FINOS](https://github.com/finos/standards-project-blueprint), and GitHub as an option for their [Minimum Viable Governance framework](https://github.blog/2021-07-22-minimum-viable-governance-lightweight-community-structure-foss-projects/).\r\n4. N/A, since meets Free Cultural Works definition.\r\n5. cc @davidru for visibility of license steward\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/953903100/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/953972143","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1344#issuecomment-953972143","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1344","id":953972143,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE8443HWv","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events",